{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_agoat2_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_agoat2_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"夜色中的第一步","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_agoat2_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"06f655ac6a87181abe80b480886214796bc128ab1267174d0c737170c4d6fc2b","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"八月二十四日。預警花培育箱內溫度：正常；濕度：正常；土壤各項成分數值：正常；分區源石活性：尚未啟動活性控制。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"今天來到了烏納火山附近的烏納村，找到新址花費了我不少時間，他們在原址向北好幾公里外的地方重新搭建了房屋並住下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在如今的烏納村裡，不論向何處眺望，我都無法看到烏納火山。只有登上最高處的屋頂，才能望見極遠處舊烏納村的廢墟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"山路又遠又崎嶇，還好這次考察我申請了載具，培育箱沒有受損，裡面預警花花苗的狀態也很好，可以立刻開始實驗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是不知道為什麼……村民們的態度很奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在我剛走進村子時，他們以為我是迷路的旅人，十分熱情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是在我介紹自己是來做火山考察的之後，他們立刻冷下臉來，不願意再和我多說一句話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿黛爾放下手中的筆，放眼望去。比起幾年前所報導的村莊被火山灰覆蓋的景象，新的烏納村早已恢復了生機。\n居民來來往往，有人撥弄著手中的樂器，房屋中傳來陣陣樂聲，幾個快樂的孩童在陽光下奔跑，用充滿好奇的目光望向阿黛爾。\n極遠處烏納火山山腳下卻有一抹灰黑，似乎是一片毫無生機的廢墟，明明很暗，卻又很顯眼，緊緊地貼在原地。\n阿黛爾四處張望，目光最終停留在那裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好在，在一個好心小朋友的幫助下，我終於找到了村長，她願意把空置的閣樓提供給我暫住……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村長","speakerId":"avg_npc_497_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打擾了，阿黛爾小姐。作為屋主，我為你泡了些熱茶，這些是你的晚餐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村長","speakerId":"avg_npc_497_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及作為村長，我也需要向你解釋一下之前村民們對你態度冷淡的這件事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝您的飯菜和茶水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村長","speakerId":"avg_npc_497_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就直接說了，我們並不喜歡提到任何有關那邊那座火山的事情，我們不想再看到它，最好是連“火山”這個詞也不要說出口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村長","speakerId":"avg_npc_497_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那場災害讓太多人離開了我們，沒有人能輕易地再提起它。你還是盡快做完你的事，盡快離開吧，今天有不少村民來找我說這件事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還是會按照原計劃做完我要做的事情，然後再離開的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"村長，我現在在做的事情與火山災害預警相關，我並不覺得這會是冒犯到村民們、讓他們對我態度惡劣的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村長","speakerId":"avg_npc_497_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……年輕人，我能明白你想說什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村長","speakerId":"avg_npc_497_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……但我們也有我們自己面對火山的方式，我們也需要時間。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"九月三日。預警花培育箱內溫度：正常；濕度：正常；土壤各項成分數值：正常；分區源石活性：尚未啟動活性控制。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我在火山上的幾處地點採集了土壤樣本，找到了一處適合育苗預警花的地點。預警花的存活率很喜人，它們在烏納火山適應得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大約半個月後是它們的花期，要是能夠從它們的顏色變化中探尋到與源石活性相關的生物狀態，或許防範火山災害會有新的可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那樣的話，就能避免更多人遭受火山所帶來的危害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"每日來往山坡花田和住所的路線我也已經熟悉，只要能趕在日落前下山，我就能一個人順利回到住處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看來需要訂定一個最晚工作時間，否則天黑之後我就完全看不清山路了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……只是村民們似乎還是很排斥我，很難和他們溝通交流。我並不想評判他們的處理方式，只是……這樣一味地逃避，真的好嗎……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對了，是時候幫這片試驗田圍上圍欄了，下午要記得找一些做圍欄的材料。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，花苞已經長出來了不少，再過幾天就都能開花了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從今天開始縮短記錄源石活性的間隔，做出分區開始控制每個實驗區的源石活性吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從這邊開始做標記……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊啊啊——嗚哇！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好痛！！這裡怎麼突然有一個圍欄擋住我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你是那天說要上火山的姐姐……你果然在這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是那天幫我指路的孩子……？有沒有受傷？你怎麼一個人跑到火山上來了？這裡對你來說不是能亂跑的地方啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，爸爸媽媽不讓我上火山，也不讓我去老村子那邊的廢墟，我就偏要來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不就是火山嗎？有什麼大不了的，我自己一個人也能爬上去……哎喲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是摔到腿了吧……你坐下來，我幫你塗一點藥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這點小傷口沒事的，姐姐，我就知道你在這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能告訴我，怎樣才能爬到火山的山頂上去嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"九月二十三日。昨天工作結束得晚了一點，又遇上下雨，試著冒雨下山，果然還是摔了一跤。還好被村民們發現，把我送回了住處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們問我怎麼天氣這麼差還上山，我和他們說了研究火山災害預警的事情。他們似乎沒那麼排斥我了，還給了我當地的藥膏，很好用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"記回工作。源石活性對預警花的顏色有著很明顯的影響，基本上源石活性每提升一級，預警花的顏色差別都能夠直接用肉眼觀察到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這段時間已經提取了足夠多的植物樣本成分進行分組實驗，希望能夠找到究竟是植株中的什麼物質造成了這一現象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果能盡快發現，或許能夠早日找到應用這種物質來提升火山預警靈敏度和精準度的新方向，準確預警火山災害的那一天或許將不再遙遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"以及，我在這裡又遇到了那個幫我指路的小朋友。從那天她摔倒在花田裡，我幫她塗了點藥之後，她幾乎天天都來找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她總是不聽父母的話跑上火山，或是到火山山腳的廢墟去，還想讓我帶她登上烏納火山的山頂……似乎對火山很感興趣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……這部分資料處理終於完成了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，小傢伙，我的工作結束了，你也該回家了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，他們都說你是來研究火山的，我在書上看到研究火山都要去山頂那種地方研究那些石頭，還要用小鏟子挖岩漿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我每天過來，你都不去山頂上，只在山坡這裡種花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼不去山頂？我還想跟著你一起上山頂呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我記得你叫小藿普，對吧？我確實每天只在山坡上，是因為我要在這裡做實驗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能告訴我你去火山的山頂上要做什麼嗎？你還太小，山頂對你來說很危險，我是不會帶你去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哼！連你也不帶我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"十月五日。分組試驗排除了一部分物質，現在的實驗環境只能做到盡量鎖定物質範圍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我需要保存樣本，等回到實驗室再進行更細緻的分析。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"預警花開得很好，等樣本採集告一段落，可以考慮擴大移植範圍，還原這裡原本的生態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"另外，昨天晚餐時村長說有村民們送的新鮮野菜，他們還問起了我的摔傷。炒野菜很好吃，和小時候爸爸媽媽帶回家的味道一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小藿普那天之後再也沒來找過我，我問了村長，村長說她最近沒再想往火山上跑，可能，是放棄了吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後再整理一下樣本分組……檢查一下標籤……很好，都沒問題……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……唔！怎麼一不注意，居然這麼晚了……好黑啊，已經有點看不清了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趁現在走快些還是能回到山下的吧……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，只有手電筒的話我的眼睛果然還是沒辦法……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然今晚就在這裡搭防護帳篷休息一晚吧，還好我之前做了準備……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……呼！終於搭好了！再鋪上防潮墊，晚上睡覺也不會有什麼問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能要噴上一點防野生動物噴霧，附近還是有不少動物的……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一陣窸窸窣窣的聲音傳來，阿黛爾疑惑地回過頭。\n一個頂著草葉和泥巴的小腦袋從一旁的岩石後探了出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇！又被發現了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快跑，快跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼晚了你怎麼還在這裡？火山對你來說太危險了！你站在這裡別動，我拿一下手電筒，把你送回村子裡去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……我……我不想回去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是想去山頂上，他們所有人都不讓我去！好不容易讓他們以為我不想去火山了才偷跑出來，沒想到又遇到了你……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不要回去，我要上山！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那你告訴我，你要上山幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說了你就會帶我上去嗎？我……我有事情要做……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小藿普從胸前掏出一個皺巴巴的花環。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要把這個放到山頂上去……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"花環……？你為什麼要把花環放到山頂上去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要是說了，你不准告訴別人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好，我答應你，我不告訴別人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我……我想我的爺爺奶奶了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的爺爺奶奶……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……小時候有一天，我睡覺突然醒來，爸爸媽媽在背著我跑，一直跑了很遠很遠……我很睏，就又睡著了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後來我也不記得怎麼回事，我們突然就不在原本的房子裡住了。我們一直住在帳篷裡，吃得很差，睡得很差，我也一直沒看到爺爺奶奶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再後來，大人們蓋了新房子，我們就住進去那裡。可是爺爺奶奶沒有跟過來啊！我說我要去找他們，我能看到我們原先的家就在那裡！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小藿普指向夜色中的某處地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但爸爸媽媽不讓我去，我一提起這件事他們就生氣。他們說，爺爺奶奶已經離開我們了，就和那個老村子一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看新聞，新聞上都說是烏納火山爆發了，我就想上火山的山頂上看看什麼是爆發……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我……爺爺奶奶會編花環陪我玩，我……我就是要去山頂上……！"},{"type":"narration","text":"委屈的孩子一股腦地說完了一大堆話，情緒激動地喘著氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼他們所有人都不讓我去火山上？為什麼我們要搬家搬得那麼遠？為什麼他們都不讓我提這件事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的很想我的爺爺奶奶！為、為什麼……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿黛爾放下手中的手電筒，望向更高處的山頂，伸出手輕輕撫著小女孩的脊背。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……來，先把眼淚擦掉，坐到我身邊來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你如果真的想去山頂，明天我們去找村長，我們和她，還有你的父母好好地談談這件事，怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在太晚了，上山很危險，你要乖乖地在這裡睡覺，不能自己偷偷跑走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……真的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們勾勾手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好，我們勾勾手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小藿普胡亂擦了擦臉上的眼淚，鑽進帳篷，在阿黛爾身邊躺下。\n她們安靜了一會。阿黛爾沉默地看著天上的星星，小藿普一會盯著石頭，一會戳戳帳篷，把手上的草稈纏了又纏，繞成一團亂麻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小藿普，睡不著嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，我跟你講一個我的故事，你想不想聽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……什麼故事……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個……關於美夢的故事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿黛爾也躺了下來，接過小女孩手上的那團草稈，編成了一隻小羊的形狀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g21_skystarry_L2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你知道嗎，有的人在睡著後，是會被粉紅色毛茸茸的小羊邀請去參加牠們的夢幻遊戲的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在那裡，牠們會滿足那個被邀請的人的願望。比如一起飛上城市的天空，在大海裡衝浪，又或者是踩著路燈和星星跳著玩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我之前，就被牠們邀請過一次喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那牠們……滿足了姐姐的什麼願望？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿黛爾把小羊形狀的草團遞給了小女孩，又拾起地上掉落的預警花，開始為小羊草團編一頂花環。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"牠們讓我見了我的爸爸媽媽一面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐的爸爸媽媽……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我現在在這裡種這些花，就是那場美夢的獎勵，也是我的爸爸媽媽當年還沒有做完的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道只要我把這些預警花好好地種出來，我就還能被那群小羊邀請。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那姐姐的爸爸媽媽呢？為什麼他們不把這些事情做完？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿黛爾停下了手上的動作，微微地笑了一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們和你的爺爺奶奶一樣，留在了這座山上，不會再回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那……姐姐你會想他們嗎？你也會哭嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……當然會了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我也會。但我覺得爸爸媽媽，還有其他人，他們肯定都不會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們自己不去火山上，也不准我去，他們都是奇怪的膽小鬼，所以他們肯定不會被小羊邀請，去滿足他們的願望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，但這可不一定喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為……其實我也是個膽小鬼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是之前問過我，為什麼我一直只在山坡種花，卻從來沒有登上過山頂嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我也害怕去那裡……我也還沒有做好準備。即使我真的來到了這座火山，但我還是一直沒能邁出前往山頂的那一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼你們大人都……你們大人都是這個樣子！你們都是膽小鬼！我還以為你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你看，我還是受到了小羊的邀請啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，其實是我做得不對嗎……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿黛爾搖搖頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看外面的這些預警花。為了做對照試驗，這片是我在貧瘠土壤上種的，那片是我在肥沃土壤上種的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們生長的環境完全不同，但是到了花期，它們都開得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們大家其實也是一樣的。每個人都有自己的處理方式，有的人會哭，有的人會不願提起，有的人會勇敢地面對……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……但這都是因為我們還沒有忘記。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿黛爾伸出雙手，展示著她剛剛完成的東西——一頂由預警花編成的花環。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我小的時候，我的爸爸媽媽也會做這種東西給我玩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要我們還記得，這些聯繫就永遠都不會消失。比如，小羊們就會發現它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你看，牠們來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"夜空下，星星之中，幾團淡粉色的雲霧慢悠悠地飄了下來。\n小女孩揉了揉眼睛，看著自己懷抱中的花環和阿黛爾手中的花環飄蕩著向半空中飛去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？我的花環……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小藿普","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的花環飛走了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，小藿普，不要亂跑！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不在這裡……她跑到哪裡去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太黑了……根本看不清啊，這裡可不是能亂跑的地方……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在一片黑暗中，阿黛爾覺得有什麼毛茸茸的東西在蹭著自己。\n她努力地四處張望著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外形小巧的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1004_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（著急的叫聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們看到小藿普了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"著急的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1008_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（一頭頂向阿黛爾）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷糊的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1012_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（把她馱在背上跑起來）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1012_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們要去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1012_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇，小心……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1012_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要掉下去了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇，我要掉下去啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你小心點！她最近又長高了，不能再像之前那樣穩穩地騎在你的肩膀上了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡提亞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好好……小阿黛爾在爸爸的肩膀上，爸爸在火山上，小阿黛爾就在火山的山頂上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡提亞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"今天是我們小阿黛爾的生日，要許一個什麼願望呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我……我的願望是和爸爸媽媽一起去火山上考察！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們跑慢一點啊……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"著急的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1008_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（戴著預警花）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷糊的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1012_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（用鼻子吹花瓣玩）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要貪玩了，我們還要去找小藿普！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"毛茸茸的生物跳躍起來，向著前方奔去，火山熱泉在前面冒著白色的熱氣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1012_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊危險……！"},{"type":"narration","text":"毛茸茸的生物們並沒有搭理這句呼喊，牠們邁開四肢，圓滾滾的身軀輕盈地越過池水，穩穩地落在了另一邊。\n牠們滿意地站在池邊抖了抖自己蓬鬆的絨毛。\n身形稍小的生物有些開心地叫了起來，搖頭晃腦地搖晃著頭上的花朵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……你們是看出我心情不太好，所以才過來的嗎……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是……多利先生讓你們來的嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高興的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1010_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（興奮地蹦跳）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"毛茸茸的生物雀躍起來，像是在回應著什麼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"彷彿是看出了背上的女孩終於明白了牠們的意思，毛茸茸的生物們興奮地邁開四肢，向著洞外奔跑起來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡提亞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好，等你再長高一點，長大一點，我們就帶你一起去火山上實地考察，到時候你就做爸爸媽媽的小助手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎？那我要快點長大！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，你快一點長大，我們就在火山上等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等你和我們一起攀登，一起做考察，一起感受它的美和它的震撼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我已經在期待那一天了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們跑得太快啦——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g11_volcanomountainside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"感受到毛茸茸生物奔跑的速度慢下來，阿黛爾慢慢地鬆開了原本緊緊抓住牠們絨毛的手。\n牠們經常在她身邊搗亂，也總是會在她心情不好的時候出來安慰她，但不應該是現在，她現在還有很重要的事情要做。\n她還要去找那個獨自消失在火山上的小女孩，她也還沒能下定決心，去真正地踏上烏納火山的山頂。\n阿黛爾調整了一下自己的呼吸，試著睜開雙眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，這裡是……山頂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們怎麼帶著我來這裡了？我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還沒……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"咩！\n咩！咩！！\n毛茸茸生物興奮的叫聲打斷了阿黛爾驚慌的言語。山腳下的天空已經完全黑了，但在山頂上，還能看到一點點落日粉紫色的餘暉。\n牠們對著山頂不住地叫著，像是在呼喚，又像是在催促。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們……究竟想要幹什麼呢……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外形小巧的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1004_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（用頭頂了頂阿黛爾）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"遠處的天空中，一頂花環悠悠地飄蕩著，兩隻渾身雪白的小羊簇擁著已經陷入沉睡的小藿普，像是一個慈愛的懷抱。\n小藿普的睡容上猶帶著淚痕，但嘴角卻掛著滿足幸福的微笑。花環輕輕地落下，落在了她的頭上。\n他們慢慢地向山腳下的烏納村飄去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……原來你在這裡啊，小藿普……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，你也被邀請了啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外形小巧的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1004_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（用頭頂了頂阿黛爾）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"著急的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1008_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（大聲地叫著）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……怎麼了？是要我也跟你們一起喊嗎……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷糊的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1012_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（期待的眼神）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……喂、喂——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外形小巧的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1004_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（著急地哼叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是這個嗎？那你們想讓我幹什麼呢……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但等我長大，那要過去多久啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那我們勾勾手？這是爸爸媽媽和小阿黛爾的約定，等你長大了，我們會一起登上火山，我們會一起看山頂上的風景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這個約定永遠生效，不論何時，不論何地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡提亞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那，我們為這個約定定一個實現的口號吧？只要說出它，爸爸媽媽就會陪長大的阿黛爾去火山考察。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想想，那就是……“山頂上的風景真的很美”吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g11_volcanomountainside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……山……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……山頂上的風景真的很美……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_hotel"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡提亞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"來，我們吹蠟燭吧。然後，爸爸媽媽有一個小祕密要告訴你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，不能耍賴，你要把蠟燭吹了才可以聽祕密！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼……呼呼！呼！我吹完了！祕密是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡提亞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"來，我們走到陽台上來。你看，天上的雙月和它們下方最亮的那顆星星，是不是很像我們三個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們是在去年注意到的，本來以為是巧合，沒想到今年雙月的下面也有一顆星星。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小阿黛爾，在你的生日這一天，天上的雙月和星星就和我們三個人一樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g11_volcanomountainside"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿黛爾抬頭望向夜空，雙月之下一顆星星正閃爍著它的光芒。\n外形小巧的生物用頭親昵地蹭著阿黛爾，慢慢地叫著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們想表達的其實是這個意思嗎……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來，今天是我的生日啊，我都忘了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來……真的走到山頂上，其實……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實也……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……其實還是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿黛爾蹲下身子，身上略微寬大的防護外套帶著火山的氣息，輕輕地擁抱著她。\n腳下的山石飛揚起熱氣，慢慢地烘乾了她臉上的淚水，彷彿一雙溫暖的手。\n她伸出手撫摸著腳下溫熱的山石，小聲地說著平時不會說出口的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸媽媽，我今年又去三座火山做了實地考察，到今天為止，我已經去過三十多座火山了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我和凱勒老師也在推進你們的研究，補全了很多之前的空缺，你們留下的諸多問題我也在一個一個解決……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對了，找到火山預警花後，我一直在努力培育它們，現在也在做植物特徵與源石活性的研究……我做了考察，這裡是最適合的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我就帶著那些預警花來……啊，今天是小羊突然帶我過來的，我還沒來得及帶上它們……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一株預警花的幼苗被遞到了阿黛爾的面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……咦？"},{"type":"narration","text":"外形小巧的生物輕輕地銜著它的根莖，後面的小羊們像是頂著球玩一般，一下又一下地將預警花花苗送到了阿黛爾的身旁。\n她接過這株自己精心培育的花朵，它柔弱的花枝昂揚著，在餘暉中努力尋找著最後一絲陽光。阿黛爾彎下腰，用手挖開泥土。\n防護外套的袖口又蹭上了這次考察的一些灰屑，她並沒有急著拂去它們，只是專心地栽下這一株小小的預警花幼苗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g11_volcanomountainside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看！是預警花，開了這麼大一片呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡提亞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"想不到在這裡也能看到……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪格娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們採一株回去做樣本吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡提亞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，就當作是這次考察回去送給小阿黛爾的禮物好了，上次她很喜歡吃我們帶回去的炒野菜呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡提亞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這株預警花她肯定也會喜歡的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g11_volcanomountainside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小羊，我們走吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外形小巧的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1004_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（開心地哼叫）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿黛爾在地上踩出一串新的腳印，小羊雀躍著跟在她的身旁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……既然已經到了這裡，我也不能停下啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"山頂上，肯定還有爸爸媽媽當年看過的風景在等著我們吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
